  -d '{
    "email": "juan@example.com",
    "password": "123456"
  }'
```

### Obtener platos

```bash
curl -X GET "http://localhost:5000/api/dishes?page=1&limit=5&available=true"
```

### Crear orden (con token)

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI" \
  -d '{
    "dishes": [
      {
        "dishId": "65a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e2",
        "quantity": 2
      }
    ],
    "paymentMethod": "card"
  }'
```

### Crear plato (admin)

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/dishes \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN_AQUI" \
  -d '{
    "name": "Nueva Pizza",
    "description": "Deliciosa pizza recién creada",
    "price": 15.99,
    "category": "main_course"
  }'
